2 CONT * Manuel Hagemann: The Klever inheritance case 1368 - Preparation and stabilization of the takeover of the dominion by the House of Mark, in: RhVjbll. 83, 2019. S. ISBN 978-3-7749-4222-6
2 CONT * Woldemar Harleß: Johann (Couve of Kleve). In: Allgemeine Deutsche Biographie (ADB). Volume 14, Duncker & Humblot, Leipzig 1881, p. 206–208.
2 CONT * Wilhelm Janssen: Johann. In: New German biography. (NDB). Band 10. Duncker & Humblot, Berlin 1974, ISBN 3-428-00191-5, p. 491–492 (deutsche-biographie.de).
2 CONT * Dieter Kastner: Die Territorialpolitik der Grafen von Kleve, Düsseldorf 1972 (= Publications of the historical association for the Lower Rhine, especially the old Archdiocese of Cologne 11).
2 CONT * Wolf-Rüdiger Schleidgen: Regsten of the Kleve-Mark stock. Documents in the North Rhine-Westphalian Main State Archive in Düsseldorf (Publications of the State Archives of the State of North Rhine-Westphalia. Series C: Sources an
