2 CONT '''Joanna of Jülich (died 1394) was the youngest daughter''' of Duke William II and his wife, Marie of Guelders.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In 1376, she married John V, Lord of Arkel''' (1362-1428). '''They had two children:
2 CONT *William (d. 1 December 1417 in Gorinchem)
2 CONT *Maria (d. 1415, in IJsselstein), married John II, Count of Egmond
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/HOLLAND.htm#JohannaGeldernMJanArkel Medlands]
2 CONT
