2 NOTE Jean II d'Avesnes, comte de Hainaut is your 18th great grandfather.
3 CONT You  → Raymond Henry Ashworth, Sr. (your father) → Susie Gertrude Ashworth (Smith) (his mother) → Nathaniel E. Smith (her father) → Nathaniel M. Smith (his father) → Jonathan Smith (his father) → Deacon Aaron Smith (his father) → 
3 CONC Abigail Nash (Kellogg) (his mother) → Lt. Joseph Kellogg (her father) → Lt. Martin Kellogg (his father) → Phillippe Kellogg (his father) → Sir Thomas Kellogg of Debden (his father) → Sir Nicholas Kellogg, I (his father) → Alice Ha
3 CONC dley (Audley) (his mother) → Sir Humphrey Audley, Kt. (her father) → Eleanor Tuchet (Holland) (his mother) → Constance, Countess of Gloucester (her mother) → Edmund of Langley, 1st Duke of York (her father) → Philippa of Hainault,
3 CONC  Queen consort of England (his mother) → William III, count of Holland (her father) → Jean II d'Avesnes, comte de Hainaut (his father)
