2 CONT *Bonne (1396–1425), who married firstly Philip Count of Nevers (1389–1415), youngest son of Philip the Bold, Duke of Burgundy; and secondly Philip the Good, Duke of Burgundy (1396–1467).
2 CONT *Catherine (1397–1422?), who married John of Bourbon, Lord of Carency.
