1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Heer van Polanen Philips van Duivenvoorde''' was born circa January 1248 in Monster, Westland, South Holland, The Netherlands. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-44273666 Heer Jan I ridder van Duivenvoorde van Wasse
2 CONC naer] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-39568101 Ghijseken Uter Lyersdr.]. He was a schatbewaarder (Treasurer) van het Graafschap Holland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philips married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626360741 N.N. N.N.]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-122184822 Willem van Duivenvoorde, heer van Oosterhout]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philips married [https://www.geni.com/profile-77807542 Elisabeth van Beusichem, vrouwe van Vianen] in November 1295. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-44296650 Johan van Duivenvoorde, heer van
2 CONC  Breda]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34691858313 Jan Dirksn van Polanen]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philips married [https://www.geni.com/profile-56379962 Christina van Cuijck] circa 1277. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 11, 1309 in Slot Boutershem, Mechelen, Antwerp, Flanders (Vlaanderen), Belgium and was buried after circa 1301 in Brussel ?. 
2 CONT ----
