1 OCCU Otto, Heer van Asperen (1305), Hagestein (1335), Vuren (1326), Ridder, geboren circa 1270, overleden circa 1344. Knape (1298); 1e Heer van Heukelom en Asperen (1305); ridder (1318); heer van Vuren (1326); van Lingenstein en Ackoy 
2 CONC (1329)
1 TITL Graaf
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MedLands ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''OTTO [II] van Heukelom''' . “Otte Here van Asperen, Ridder” confirmed holding “Linghensteyne” from the count of Holland, in the presence of “minen...broeder Heren Arnoud van Hoekelem, Heren Jan van Hoekelem, zinen zone, minen n
2 CONC eve, ende Heren Otten van Asperen minen sone”, by charter dated 20 Sep 1329[136]. “Arnoud van Hoeclem, Ridder” confirmed holding “Merenborch” from the count of Holland, in the presence of “minen...broeder Heren Otten Here van Aspe
2 CONC ren, Heren Otten van Asperen sinen zone, minen neve, end Hair Jan van Hoeclem minen zone”, by charter dated 20 Sep 1329[137]. m ALEID bâtarde de Hainaut, illegitimate daughter of GUY de Hainaut Bishop of Utrecht & his mistress ---
2 CONC  (-1347). “Guydo...Bisscop van Utrecht” donated “der herschappie van Aemstelle” to “Marien onser dochter, Heren Arnouds wyfe van Yselsteine, Ridders”, and similar property to “Aleyden onser dochter, Otten soens wyfe van Asperen”, 
2 CONC by charter dated 29 Nov 1316, witnessed by “...Here Ghisebrecht Here van Yselsteyn...”[138].
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DUTCH%20NOBILITY.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT (Translation via Google Translate from dutch) 
2 CONT 19. ( bark ). Aleid Avesnes (see Gens Nostra 1990 blz.499 ) , promises to submit to arbitration regarding the custody of her children 2-9-1346 , died . after 19-3-1347 , tr . before 29-11-1316 Otto II van Asperen , Knape 29-11-131
2 CONC 6 , 20-9-1329 is knight , to succeed his father , Mr van Asperen and Hagestein shortly after 22-4-1344 , but already killed Stavoren 26- 9-1345 , n. Otto I of Heukelom, Mr. van Asperen and (since 22-8-1335 ) Hagestein , and presum
2 CONC ably his first wife who was possibly a daughter of Allard van Buren.
2 CONT
2 CONT 20. Elburg van Asperen , Lady of Asperen , Dr . Otto II van Asperen and Hagestein , knight, and Aleijd Avesnes , tr . 1366 Dirck van Polans called van der lecke , leader of Hoeksen in 1358 , Sheriff of Heusden 1359, Mr. van Aspere
2 CONC n 1366 , died . between 30-6-1412 and 8-1-1413 .
