1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT In Gens Nostra series 66 is saïd Willem de Cuser is not the bastard sohn of Jean II d'Avesnes but rightly a grandson or great-grandson of Jean I d'Avesnes and Aleida van Holland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alias: Willem Cuser. William is Willem in Dutch, and William was originated from the Netherlands, so I changed his English name back to the Dutch version of Willem. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =The family crest of Willem=
2 CONT His personal family crest was blue, 1 and 4 crest of Hainaut, 2 and 3 crest of Holland. Source: http://www.historici.nl/retroboeken/nnbw/#source=7&page=178&accessor=accessor_index
2 CONT
2 CONT Interessanting info (in dutch) about  Willem de Cuser and Gerrit de Boele:  http://books.google.nl/books?id=0BTWZdsiTmAC&pg=PA98&lpg=PA98&dq=Gerrit+De+Boele+baljuw+Amstelland&source=bl&ots=gm95mY_ivK&sig=kMoAl7r1Xv0mwsl02L_qL9wDpW
