2 CONC iara di Napoli"[909]. '''m''' (Paris 4 Oct 1323, in person May 1324) as his second wife, '''CHARLES of Sicily''', son of ROBERT King of Sicily and Jerusalem [Anjou-Capet] & his first Infanta doña Violanta de Aragón ([28 May] 1298-
2 CONC Naples 10 Nov 1328, bur Naples, Santa Chiara). He was installed as Duca di Calabria in 1325, Viceroy of Sicily.
2 CONT
