2 CONC ngdom (put under the suzerainty of the pope by Peter II in 1205) forfeit. He granted Aragon to Charles, Count of Valois, Philip's son. Philip intervened in the Navarrese succession after the death of Henry I of Navarre and married
2 CONC  his son, Philip the Fair, to the heiress of Navarre, Joan I.
