2 CONT
2 CONT Robert (1269 - 1271). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles (March 12, 1270 – December 16, 1325), Count of Valois. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Stillborn son (1271). 
2 CONT
2 CONT After Isabella's death, he married on 21 August 1274, Marie de Brabant, daughter of Henry III of Brabant and Adelaide of Burgundy. Their children were:
