2 CONC  de Poitiers Dec 1311.  He was appointed regent on the death of his brother in 1316, awaiting the birth of his nephew.  He succeeded his nephew in 1316 as PHILIPPE V "le Long" King of France, FELIPE II King of Navarre.  He was con
