2 CONC e de Valois, son of PHILIPPE VI King of France & his first wife Jeanne "la Boiteuse" de Bourgogne (Château du Bois-de-Vincennes 1 Jul 1336-Orléans 1 Sep 1375, bur Orléans, église Sainte-Croix).  He was created Duc d'Orléans, Comte
2 CONC  de Beaumont-le-Roger, Vicomte de Breteuil by his father 16 Apr 1344. 
