2 CONT 7.             ROBERT de France (1297-Saint-Germain-en-Laye Aug 1307, bur Priory of Poissy, église de Saint Louis).  Betrothed (Oct 1306) to CONSTANZA of Sicily, daughter of FEDERIGO I King of Sicily [Aragon] & his wife Eléonore o
