2 CONC ecially unpopular ones, to his ministers, he was called a "useless owl" by his contemporaries. His reign marks the French transition from a charismatic monarchy – which could all but collapse in an incompetent reign – to a bureauc
2 CONC ratic kingdom, a move towards modernity.
