2 NOTE Children: Edward, Prince of Wales, known as The Black Prince; Isabella, married Enguerrand VII of Coucy; Lady Joan, died in the Black Death epidemic of 1348; Lionel of Antwerp, Duke of Clarence; John of Gaunt, Duke of Lancaster; E
3 CONC dmund of Langley, Duke of York; Mary of Waltham, married John V of Brittany; Margaret, married John Hastings, Earl of Pembroke; Thomas of Woodstock, Duke of Gloucester; five died in infancy.
