2 CONT Matilda of Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda of Brabant (1224-September 29, 1288) was the daughter of Henry II, Duke of Brabant. She was first married to Robert of Artois. By him she had two children, Blanche of Artois, the wife of Henry I and Edmund Croachback and R
2 CONC obert II of Artois. After his death in 1250 she married Guy II of Châtillon, Count of Saint Pol. Through her daughter Blanche she is an ancestor of Edward III and thus of the modern British royal family.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matilda_of_Brabant
2 CONT
