2 CONT
2 CONT     * Isabeau of Châtillon (d. May 19, 1360), married in May 1311 Guillaume I de Coucy, Lord of Coucy
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Marie of Châtillon, married Aymer de Valence, 2nd Earl of Pembroke
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Eleanor of Châtillon, married Jean III Malet, Lord of Granville
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Jeanne of Châtillon, married Miles de Noyers, Lord of Maisy
