2 CONT After the extinction of the Limburg house in 1280, he pretended to be the new count of Limburg, just like some cousins who, like him, also descend from the Limburg house in female lines. Count Jan from Brabant wins this with the r
2 CONC esult that Walmram became a robber baron.
2 CONT
2 CONT A Robber baron is a baron without land or status, But is a gun for hire. Or his case a baron that has an armor, horse, weapons, footsmen, knights and a strongholt.
2 CONT
2 CONT See the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robber_baron_(feudalism) wikipedia] article about this.
