2 CONC teenth and Early Fourteenth Century Ireland: Roger Bigod and the de Clare lords of Thomond, Beth Hartland, King's College, London, The English Historical Review, 2007, oxfordjournals.org ^ Jump up to: a b c Richardson I 2011, p. 2
2 CONC 04. Jump up ^ Tout 139, McFarlane 262
2 CONT
