2 CONC rls?". The Nobility of Later Medieval England. pp. 248–267., reprinted from History, 50 (1965), 145-59 Stubbs, William (1906). The Constitutional History of England in Its Origin and Development, vol. 2.
2 CONT  Thompson, Edward Maunde (1886). "Bigod, Roger (1245-1306)". In Stephen, Leslie. Dictionary of National Biography 5. London: Smith, Elder & Co. pp. 26–27. Tout, T. F. (1894). "The Earldoms under Edward I". Transactions of the Roya
