2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne of Berry (1365-1435) was the daughter of John, Duke of Berry. She married Amadeus VII, Count of Savoy and acted as regent for their son Amadeus VIII after his death in 1391.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard VII, Count of Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard's first wife was Bonne de Berry, the daughter of Duke Jean de Berry and widow of Count Amédée VII of Savoy. He married his daughter Bonne d'Armagnac to the young Charles, Duke of Orléans in 1410.
2 CONT
