1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Heer van Duivenvoorde Jan ridder van Duivenvoorde van Wassenaer''' was born on December 11, 1229 in Voorschoten, Voorschoten, South Holland, Netherlands. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-44276383 Philips II, heer 
2 CONC van Wassenaer en Duivenvoorde] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-44273665 Florentia Arentsdr van Rijswijck, vrouw van Strijen]. He was a Ridder. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jan married [https://www.geni.com/profile-39568101 Ghijseken Uter Lyersdr.]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-39567704 Heer van Polanen Philips van Duivenvoorde]; [https://www.geni.com/profil
2 CONC e-129613168 Elisabeth van Wassenaer]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 13, 1295 in Kasteel Duivenvoorde, Voorschoten, Voorschoten, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
