1 NAME Johanna Johanna /van Polanen/
2 GIVN Johanna Johanna
2 SURN van Polanen
2 _MARNM Nassau-Vianden-Dietz-Dillenburg
2 NICK FROM THE NOBLE FAMILY House of Wassenaer
1 SEX F
1 BURI
