2 ADDR
3 CITY Breda
3 STAE Provincia Noord-Brabant
3 CTRY Nederland
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 JAN 1392
2 ADDR
3 CITY Probably Breda
3 STAE Hertogdom Brabant
3 CTRY Heilige Roomse Rijk (within present The Netherlands)
