1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Annas ancestry has been corrected. Anna is not the daughter of Philip Lamoraal Graf von Egmont and Sabine Graf von Egmont. She is the more likely the daughter of Frederik Egmont Van Meerenstein (Van Egmont) and N.N
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna's ancestry is perhaps fictitious.
2 CONT
2 CONT Finn Holbek: Min 10xtip Anna von Egmont (eller iflg. F.S. Anna (bastaard) van Egmont), skulle være uægte datter af Graf Lamoral von Egmont.
2 CONT
2 CONT See http://www.dis-danmark.dk/forum/read.php?1,313877,313990
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Fødsel: 1550 - Westerholm, Schleswig-Holstein.  Død: 1593 - Heide, Holstein, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT Forældre: Philip Lamoraal Graf von Egmond, Sabine Graf von Egmond (født von der Pfalz-Simmern Witelsbach) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Søskende: Anna van Egmondt, Eleonora Lamoraal Jan van Egmond von hornes (født van Egmond), Madeleine van Egmont, Seger van Egmond, Isabella van Egmont, Maria Christina de bournonville (født van Egmont), Filips van Egmont, Sabina v
2 CONC an Egmont, Lamoraal van Egmont, Karel II van Egmont, Johanna van Egmont, Francine van Egmont 
2 CONT
