2 CONT http://www.fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BRABANT,%20LOUVAIN.htm#_Toc217396339
2 CONT
2 CONT ALEIDIS de Brabant (-[1261/67]).  The Oude Kronik van Brabant names "Mariam, conthoralem Ottonis Quartus Romanorum imperatoris, Aleydam comitssam Auernie, Margaretam comitissam Gerardi comitis Ghelrie et Mechteldim, primo quidem c
2 CONC omitissam Palatinam Rheni, postea…comitissam Hollandie" as the daughters of "Henricus…primus, dux Lotharingie" and his wife "Mechteldim, filiam Mathei Boloniensis comitis"[168].  The Genealogia Ducum Brabantiæ Heredum Franciæ refe
2 CONC rs to the third of the four daughters of "Henricus dux" as the wife of "comes de Alvernia" and mother of "Robertum comitem Bolonie et Alvernie et fratres eius et sorores"[169].  The primary sources which confirm her first and thir
2 CONC d marriages, have not yet been identified.  m firstly (1206) ARNAUD Comte de Looz Graf von Rieneck, son of GERARD [II] Comte de Looz Graf von Rieneck & his wife Adelheid van Gelderland (-before 1225).  m secondly (before 3 Feb 122
2 CONC 5) as his second wife, GUILLAUME [IX] Comte d'Auvergne, son of GUY [II] Comte d'Auvergne & his first wife Pernelle de Chambon (-1246, bur Le Bouchet).  m thirdly (before Dec 1251) as his second wife, ARNOUT [III] Heer van Wesemaal
2 CONC   Marshall of Brabant, son of ARNOUT [II] Heer van Wesemaal & his first wife --- van Montferrant (-1260). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ad%C3%A9la%C3%AFde_de_Brabant
