1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_of_Flanders,_Duchess_of_Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of Flanders (died July 3, 1285) was the daughter of Guy of Dampierre, and wife of John I, Duke of Brabant.
2 CONT
2 CONT They were married in 1273. She was the mother of:
2 CONT
2 CONT Godfrey (1273/74 – aft. September 13, 1283).
2 CONT
2 CONT John II of Brabant (1275–1312).
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of Brabant (4 October 1276–14 December 1311, Genoa), married 9 June 1292 to Henry VII, Holy Roman Emperor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie (d. after 2 December 1338), married to Count Amadeus V of Savoy.
2 CONT
2 CONT
