1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jeanne de Fiennes   
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne was born in 1300 in Fiennes,Artois,Pas De Calis,France.  Jeanne's father was Jean de Fiennes and her mother was Isabelle de Dampierre.  Her maternal grandparents were Guy de Dampierre, Comte de Flandre and Isabel de Luxembo
2 CONC urg.  She was an only child.  She died at the age of 53 on July 7th, 1353.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor Pedigree Chart
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne's family with Jean de Chatillon
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne and Jean were married in a religious ceremony in December 1329 in France.  They had a daughter named Maud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Maud de Chatillon
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud was born in 1339 in Ligny et Barrois, Meuse, France.  She died at the age of 39 in 1378 in Saint Pol.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  Jeanne de Fiennes is the daughter of Jean de Fiennes and Isabelle de Dampierre. 
2 CONT
2 CONT      Jeanne de Fiennes was living on 12 March 1357.
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly in December (1319 OR 1329) Jean de Châtillon, Comte de St. Pol in son of ---.  m secondly (1344) JEAN de Mortagne, son of ---.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Jeanne de Fiennes and Jean de Châtillon, Comte de St. Pol
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Maud de Châtillon+1 d. a 27 Aug 1371
2 CONT
