2 CONT Charles successfully curbed inflation, introducing new coins with a constantly high purity of gold. Florins minted, from 1325, in a newly established mint in Kremnica became soon the popular international means of payment througho
2 CONC ut Europe. The reform of the currency and of the whole fiscal system greatly contributed to enrich the treasury.
