2 CONT '''Louis II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon was born on 4 February 1337.1 He was the son of''' Pierre I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon and Isabel de Valois.1 '''He married Anne de Clermont, Comtesse de Forez, daughter of''' Beraud II de Cl
2 CONC ermont, Dauphin d'Auvergne, '''on 19 August 1371.1 He died on 10 August 1410 at age 73.'''1
2 CONT '''     Louis II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon also went by the nick-name of Louis 'the Good'.3 He gained the title of Duc de Bourbon.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Louis II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon and Anne de Clermont, Comtesse de Forez'''
2 CONT 1. Jean I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon+1 b. 1380, d. 1434
2 CONT 2. Louis de Bourbon1 b. 1388, d. 1404
