1 NOTE Like his grandfather, ascended to the crown at the age of five. It was run by
2 CONT a regency until he came of age; and his uncle Sanc, Count of Provence,
2 CONT managed the finances and paid off his father's debts. He later became known
2 CONT for leading military campaigns that captured Majorca and the other Balearic
2 CONT islands, as well as Valencia, from the Moors.
