1 NOTE Also known as Yolande, but not to be confused with another much later Yolande.
2 CONT Note: Marriage dates may look weird because the woman who married was a young girl.
2 CONT But it was often the custom of those times to put together a marriage contract while the child was very young. Often there was a period of waiting for when the child was of right mind.
2 CONT Then the marriage was consumated later.
