2 CONC and his wife Constanza[561].  Don Fadrique was proclaimed Lord at Palermo 12 Dec 1295, and recognised as FEDERIGO I King of Sicily by the Parliament-General at Catania 15 Jan 1296, crowned at Palermo 25 Mar 1296.  For other detail
2 CONC s of his life see SICILY.    
