2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Margaret (1288 – c. 1294)
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Louis X of France, King Louis I of Navarre from 1305, France from 1314 (October 1289 – 5 June 1316)
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Blanche (1290 – c. 1294)
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Philip V of France and Navarre (as Philip II) (1292/93 – 3 January 1322)
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Charles IV of France and Navarre (as Charles I) (c. 1294 – 1 February 1328)
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. Isabella (c. 1295 – 23 August 1358), married Edward II of England
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. Robert (1297 – July 1308)
