1 NOTE KNOWN AS "PHILLIP THE LONG""THE TALL"; REGENT FROM 6/5/1316 UNTIL HE BECAME
2 CONT KING OF FRANCE 11/19/(OR 20) 1316, AND WAS CROWNED AT RHEIMS 1/9/1317; KING
