2 CONT He married Elizabeth, who appears to have predcceased him. He died 16March 1372/3, at Halse or Hawes, Brackley, and was buried in St. James'sChapel, Brackley.  [Complete Peerage VI:531, (transcribed by DaveUtzinger)]
