2 CONC  sole heir, who m. John Lovel,5th Lord Lovel, of Tichmersh, and carried the Barony of Holland into thatfamily. [Sir Bernard Burke, Dormant and Extinct Peerages, Burke'sPeerage, Ltd., London, 1883, p. 279, Holand, Barons Holand]
