2 CONT www.celtic-casimir.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret DE HOLAND 
2 CONT 	Born: Abt 1340, Hawes, Brackley, Northamptonshire, England 
2 CONT 	Married: After 1343 
2 CONT 	Died: After 1365
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Margaret married Marmaduke DE LUMLEY & Chevington, son of Sir Robert DE LUMLEY & Chevington and Lucy DE THWENG, after 1343  (Marmaduke DE LUMLEY & Chevington was born on 4 Sep 1314 in West Chevington, Morpeth, Northumberland, Engl
2 CONC and and died on 26 Sep 1365 in Little Lumley, Chester le Street, Durham, England.)
2 CONT
2 CONT www.findagrave.com
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/215615664/margaret-lumley?_gl=1*1a5mpl8*_gcl_au*NzUzNTYxNzQ0LjE3ODQ4NTc3MzA.*_ga*MzYwMDUwMDgzLjE3NzcwNzMzODE.*_ga_4QT8FMEX30*czQ5OGYxMzIxLTM0ZmItNDZmYS04YTBmLTkzNjM1NzA4ZTU0NSRvNDAzJGcxJHQxNzg2N
