2 CONT DEATH unknown
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT St Mary and St Cuthbert Churchyard
2 CONT Chester-Le-Street, Durham Unitary Authority, County Durham, England
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 215615664
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret, dtr of Robert De Holland IV - the memorial for spouse states "here lyeth Marmaduke...and his wife Margaret...She was born circa 1340 and died after 1365.
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT HERE LIETH SIR. MARMADVKE LVMLEY KNIGHT
2 CONT AND DAME MARGARET HIS WIFE DAVGHTER OF
2 CONT HOLLAND, SONNE OF SIR ROBERT LVMLEY KNIGHT
2 CONT AND LVCIA ELDEST SISTER AND COHEYRE OF THOMAS
2 CONT THWINGE, SONNE OF SIR ROGER LVMLEY KNIGHT AND
2 CONT BARON OF MORIK, WHICH ROGER WAS BVRIED IN THE
2 CONT FRIERS MINORS AT NEWCASTEL; SONNE OF SIR WILLIAM
2 CONT LVMLEY KNIGHT AND OF THE DAVGHTER AND HEYRE OF
2 CONT SIR WALTER DAVDRE OF MORTON DAVDRE, SONNE OF
2 CONT SIR WILLIAM LVMLEY, SIR OF SIR WILLIAM LVMLEY
2 CONT AND OF IVHETA OF OF HESELDEN, SONNE OF VTTRED OF
2 CONT LVMLEY, SONNE OF LIVLPHVS AND ALGITHA DAVGHTER
2 CONT OF ALDRED EARLE OF NORTHUMBERLAND, ANNO. 1080.
2 CONT THIS MARMADUKE AFTER THE DEATH OF HIS SAID MOTHER
2 CONT DID BEARE AND VSE THE ARMES OF THWINGE, AND HE DIED
2 CONT ANNO.44.EDWARDI TERTII. HE HAD ISSVE RAFFE LORDE
2 CONT LVMLEY CREATED BARON BY KINGE RICHARD.2.ANNO
2 CONT REGNI.8. HEWAS GOVERNOR OF BEREWIK ANNO .10.
2 CONT RICHARDI.2. HE MARIED ELEANOR DAVGHTER OF IHON
2 CONT LORDE NEVEL SISTER TO RAFFE FIRST EARLE OF
2 CONT WESTMERLAND; HE DIED ANNO. I . HENRICI .4. HE HAD
2 CONT ISSVE SIR IHON LVMLEY KNIGHT MARIED TO FELICIA
2 CONT THE DAVGHTER OF REDHAM HE DIED ANNO.9.HENRICI
2 CONT 5. AND HE HAD ISSVE THOMAS LORD LVMLEY WHO
2 CONT MARIED MARGARET DAVGTER OF SIR IAMES HARINGTON
2 CONT KNIGHT, AND LIETH ENTOMBED IN THIS CHVRCHE ANNO
2 CONT .2. RICHARDI. 3 .
