2 _MARNM von Bayern
1 NAME Beatrix Queen Consort of Sweden
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1344
2 PLAC Of, Brandenburg, Brandenburg, Prussia
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 DEC 1359
2 ADDR
