1 NOTE !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. The Royal Dau of Eng., Eng. 120, v. 1, tab. II, pt. I, II, p. 63, 224-25,228-32, 241-42
2 CONT     2. Dict. of Nat'l Biog., Eng. Pub. A, v. 17, p. 48-69
