1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Thomas of Woodstock, 1st Duke of Gloucester, 1st Earl of Buckingham, 1st Earl of Essex, Duke of Aumale, KG (7 January 1355 – 8 or 9 September 1397) was the thirteenth and youngest child of King Edward III of Engla
2 CONC nd and Philippa of Hainault. He was the fifth of the five sons of Edward III who survived to adulthood."
