2 CONT
2 CONT Nobility, only son of Henri II and his first wife Maria of Hohenstaufen. He succeeded his father as Duke de Brabant in 1248. He married Alix de Bourgogne in 1251 who bore him four children, including Jean who succeeded him and Mar
2 CONC ie who became Queen of France.
