2 CONT      Yolande de Aragón was born in 1380.1 She is the daughter of Juan I, Rey de Aragón and Mathe d'Armagnac.1 She married Louis II, Duc d'Anjou, son of Louis I, Duc d'Anjou and Marie de Châtillon, on 2 December 1400. She died on 1
2 CONC 4 November 1442 at Chateau de Truce-de-Saumur. Children of Yolande de Aragón and Louis II, Duc d'Anjou 1.Charles le Maine+2 2.Louis III, Duc d'Anjou b. 1403, d. 1434 3.Maria d'Anjou+ b. 1404, d. 1463 4.René I 'the Good', Duc d'Anj
