2 CONC es, Literature and General Information. 11th ed., Cambridge, Eng: At the University Press, 1910. googlebooks.com Accessed November 17, 2007 This article incorporates text from the Encyclopædia Britannica Eleventh Edition, a public
2 CONC ation now in the public domain.
