2 CONC  Ranulph 14s., and for the guard of the castle of Sterdeford 18d. [Essex.] Extent, Tuesday before St. Margaret, 9 Edw. I [22 Jul 1281] North Welde. The manor, whence are rendered yearly 13s. 4d. to the chapel in the court: the man
