2 CONT Hugh Bigod, Justiciar of England was born on 1211 in Thetford, Norfolk, England to Hugh Bigod, 3rd Earl of Norfolk and Maud Marshal Bigod.  Hugh married Joan de Stuteville and had a child:  Roger Bigod, 5th Earl of Norfolk.  He pa
