2 CONC y him mother of Roger Bigod, 5th and last Earl of Norfolk of the 1140-41 creation), '''eldest daughter and coheir of Nicholas de Stuteville by Devorguille, daughter of Roland,''' ''feudal Lord of Galloway and Constable of Scotland
