2 CONT '''     Agnes de Bourgogne was born in 1407.1 She was the daughter''' of Jean I de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne and Marguerite von Bayern-Straubing.2,1 '''She married Charles I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon''', son of Jean I de Bourbon, 
2 CONC Duc de Bourbon and Marie de Berry, '''in 1425 at Autun, FranceG.1 She died on 1 December 1476.'''
2 CONT '''Children of Agnes de Bourgogne and Charles I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon'''
2 CONT 1. Jean II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon+1 b. 1426, d. 1488
2 CONT 2. Charles II de Bourbon1 b. 1434, d. 1488
2 CONT 3. Isabel de Bourbon+1 b. c 1435, d. 25 Sep 1465
