1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Willem van Cuijk was born about 1264, in Grave, Brabant, Netherlands, his father, Jan I. van Cuijk, was 35 and his mother, Jutta von Nassau, was 41. He married Johanna Sofia van Hoogstraten van Elsloo van Gymn
2 CONC ic in 1295. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 2 daughters. His occupation is listed as heer in Cuijk, North Brabant, Netherlands. He died on 12 August 1303, in his hometown, at the age of 40.
2 CONT -FS
2 CONT
2 CONT Willem van Cuyck († 1303) Mentioned in 1295-1303. Knight. He married (ca. 1295) Sofia of Gimnich (Gymnich), lady of Hoogstraten and Wortel, daughter of Wenemar and Johanna of Elslo. They had three children:
2 CONT 1. Jan III
2 CONT 2. Wenemar of Hoogstraten, knight. Mentioned 1325-1357. Had children with Elisabeth Smeets, daughter of Wouter.
2 CONT 3. NN (daughter). Married Jan II, Count of Megen.
2 CONT
