2 CONT Deleted birth and death information!
2 CONT 1. The Geographical Absurdity: "Halewijn Bij Den Bosch"
2 CONT The Error: The claim that she was born in "Halewijn Bij Den Bosch" in North Brabant is a hilarious topographical hallucination.
2 CONT The Reality: The ancestral home of the family is Halluin (Halewijn), located on the Lys River on the border of Flanders and France (near Menen and Kortrijk). There is no historical medieval lordly estate or village called "Halewij
2 CONC n near 's-Hertogenbosch" in North Brabant.
2 CONT 2. The Misread Death Date: "Mar 18 1467"
2 CONT The Error: Reporting her death as 18 March 1467 at Kasteel Veere.
2 CONT The Reality: We have the physical stone epitaph at Ter Veere preserved by Béthune and cited by Cawley. The stone explicitly carved her death date into history as 31 December 1467.
2 CONT 3. The Fabricated Birth Year: "1408"
2 CONT The Error: Claiming a precise birth year of 1408 without a single charter citation!
2 CONT 4. The "match" for the GenealogyOnline tree mentioned has been rejected as itself says "The data shown has no sources" (For some unknown reason it will not delete!) and the children shown to be heers are all confirmed "bastards" b
2 CONC orn to her husband Hendrik 4 van Borssele out of wedlock!
2 CONT
