4 CONT
4 CONT 15 And Eliud begat Eleazar; and Eleazar begat Matthan; and Matthan begat Jacob;
4 CONT
4 CONT 16 And Jacob begat Joseph the husband of Mary, of whom was born Jesus, who is called Christ.
