1 OCCU Comte de Brienne et Conversano, Seigneur d'Enghien, Duc titulaire d'Athènes, Lord of Enghien (1381 - 1394); Count of Brienne; Titular Duke of Athens, titular Duke of Athens, Count of Brienne and Lord of Enghiend 1381-1394, Count o
2 CONC f Conversano 1356-1394
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis,_Count_of_Enghien
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis of Enghien (d. March 17, 1394, Conversano) titular Duke of Athens, Count of Brienne and Lord of Enghien 1381–1394, Count of Conversano 1356–1394. His coat-of-arms was "Enghien (gyronny of eight argent and sable crusilly or),
2 CONC  a label gules bezantee".
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis was the fourth son of Walter III of Enghien and Isabella of Brienne. When his mother divided the inheritance of his uncle Walter VI of Brienne among her sons, he received the title of Count of Conversano. In 1370, he and his
2 CONC  brothers, including John of Enghien, wrote to the Doge of Venice to request Venetian aid in reclaiming Athens from the Catalan Company, but help was not forthcoming. On the death of his childless nephew Walter V of Enghien in 138
2 CONC 1, he also became titular Duke of Athens, Count of Brienne and Lord of Enghien. He married Giovanna of Sanseverino, and they had four daughters: Marguerite, Yolande, Isabelle, and Helene. On his death on March 17, 1394, his titles
2 CONC  were inherited by his eldest daughter, Marguerite (born 1365). In 1380, Marguerite married John of Luxembourg, Sire of Beauvois (died 1397), son of Guy of Luxembourg and Mahaut of Chatillon, by whom she had issue, including Peter
2 CONC  of Luxembourg, Count of St. Pol, of Brienne and of Conversano, and John II of Luxembourg, Count of Ligny. Peter married in his own turn, Margaret de Baux, by whom he had nine children. Peter and Margaret were the maternal grandpa
2 CONC rents of Queen consort Elizabeth Woodville and the ancestors of Mary, Queen of Scots.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Relationship to Lady Jane Grey'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 282 - 6th Great-grandfather
2 CONT
2 CONT 506 - 6th Great-grandfather
