1 CONC ambridge Studies in Medieval Life and Thought, 3rd ser., 19 (1983) + J. Cherry and N. Stratford, Westminster kings and the medieval palace of Westminster (1995) + P. F. Dembowski, Jean Froissart and his 'Meliador': context, craft 
