0 @N6000000005076735946@ NOTE Duc de Bretagne
1 CONT
1 CONT Jean III de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne was born in 1286.2 He was the son of Arthur II de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne and Yolande de Dreux.1 He married, firstly, Isabelle de Valois in 1297. He married, secondly, Isabel de Castilla, da
1 CONC ughter of Sancho IV, Rey de Castilla y León and Maria de Molina, in 1310.2 He married, thirdly, Jeanne de Flandre, daughter of Louis de Flandre, Comte de Nevers, in 1329 at Chartres, France.1 He died circa September 1345.1 He was 
1 CONC also reported to have died in 1341.2
1 CONT      Jean III de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne gained the title of Comte de Montfort.3 Jean III de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne also went by the nick-name of Jean 'the Good'.4 He gained the title of Duc de Bretagne in 1312.1 He gained th
1 CONC e title of Duc de Bretagne in 1341.
1 CONT Child of Jean III de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne and Jeanne de Flandre
1 CONT Joan de Bretagne d. 8 Nov 14023
1 CONT Child of Jean III de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne
1 CONT Jean IV de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne+ b. 1339, d. 1 Nov 1399
