0 @N6000000002322315426@ NOTE Isabella was ignored and abused by her husband, Ladislas IV; he preferred
1 CONT Cunan mistresses. Pope Nicholas IV decided the crown of Hungary should pass
1 CONT to the Angevin Charles Martel, son of Ladislas' sister Maria by her marriage
1 CONT to Isabella's brother Charles II of Naples & Sicily. On august 8, 1288, the
1 CONT pope proclaimed a crusade against Ladislas IV and civil war convulsed Hungary
1 CONT while Ladislas was driven from one end of the kingdom to the other. Finally,
1 CONT he was killed in his own camp by the Cunans.
