1 CONT establish the future power of the Habsburg dynasty in Austria. His minority
1 CONT was troubled by palace revolutions and civil wars. His mother was a princess
1 CONT of the Cunans, a Turkic people from the Black Sea area that had settled in
1 CONT Hungary. Ladislas, a talented but wild and reckless man, came into conflict
1 CONT with his own magnates when he married Isabella of Anjou but neglected her for
1 CONT his Cunan mistresses, and by wearing Cunan dress and having Cunan friends.
