0 @N6000000002188307919@ NOTE Blanca of Bourbon
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Blanche de Bourbon (1339 – 1361) was daughter of Peter I, Duke of Bourbon and Isabella of Valois.
1 CONT
1 CONT On 3 July 1353 she married King Peter of Castile.
1 CONT
1 CONT Eventually she was imprisoned in the castle of Arevalo.
1 CONT
1 CONT She died in Medina Sidonia at the age of twenty-two. The legend says that she was killed by a crossbowman sent by the king himself. Another legend speaks of poisoning.
1 CONT
