0 @N6000000002188307930@ NOTE Bonne of Bourbon
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Bonne of Bourbon (1341 – Château de Mâcon, January 19, 1402) was a daughter of Peter I, Duke of Bourbon and hence a sister of Jeanne de Bourbon.
1 CONT
1 CONT She married Count Amadeus VI of Savoy in 1355 in Paris. They had two children:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Amadeus VII of Savoy (1360 - November 1, 1391). He married Bonne of Berry (1365–1435), daughter of Duke John of Berry and a niece of Bonne of Bourbon.
1 CONT     * Louis of Savoy (1362 - 1365).
