0 @N6000000002240801632@ NOTE Duke of Upper Bavaria from 1294 and united Bavaria 1340-1347, first of the
1 CONT Wittlesbach line of German Emperors, his reign was marked by incessant
1 CONT diplomatic and military struggles to defend the right of the empire to elect
1 CONT an emperor independently of the papacy, to consolidate his own position, and
1 CONT to improve the status of his family. Louis finally managed to force John of
1 CONT Bohemia to nenounce all claims to Italy and to acknowledge Louis emperor in
1 CONT 1339. See message with third wife, Margaret.
