1 CONT 2.   Thomasine Beaufort, mar Reginald de Grey, 7th Baron Grey de Wilton and had issue.
1 CONT 2.   Edmund Beaufort, 1st Duke of Somerset (second creation), mar Eleanor Beauchamp [descendant of Edward I] and had issue:
1 CONT 1.   Henry Beaufort, 2nd Duke of Somerset, associated with Joan Hill and had illegitimate issue:
1 CONT 1.   Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester.
1 CONT 2.   Margaret Beaufort, mar Humphrey Stafford, Earl of Stafford and had issue.
1 CONT 3.   Joan Beaufort,
1 CONT mar 1stly to James I, King of Scotland and had issue,
1 CONT mar 2ndly to Sir James Stewart and had issue.
1 CONT
1 CONT Joan de Beaufort (see here),
1 CONT born c.1379, Beaufort Castle, Anjou,
1 CONT mar 2ndly, 1396, to Ralph Neville, 1st Earl of Westmoreland and had issue.
