1 CONT </head>
1 CONT <body>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester1 
1 CONT &lt;http://thepeerage.com/livingn.gif&gt;</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">M, #101884, b. 7 January 1355, d. 8 September 1397</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt"><b>Pedigree</b></span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester|b. 7 Jan 1355\nd. 8 Sep 
1 CONT 1397|p10189.htm#i101884|Edward III, King of England|b. 13 Nov 1312\nd. 21 Jun 
1 CONT 1377|p10188.htm#i101871|Philippe de Hainaut|b. 24 Jun 1311\nd. 15 Aug 
1 CONT 1369|p10188.htm#i101872|Edward I., King of England|b. 25 Apr 1284\nd. 21 Sep 
1 CONT 1327|p10094.htm#i100933|Isabelle de France|b. bt 1292 - 1295\nd. 22 Aug 
1 CONT 1358|p10078.htm#i100774|Guillaume V (III), Comte de Hainaut, Hollande et 
1 CONT Z&#233;lande|b. 1280\nd. 7 Jun 1337|p10270.htm#i102699|Jeanne de Valois|b. c 
1 CONT 1294\nd. 1342|p10725.htm#i107242|</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">Last Edited=25 Mar 2006</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">Consanguinity Index=3.1%</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester was born on 7 January 
1 CONT 1355 at Woodstock Palace, Woodstock, Oxfordshire, England.1 He was the son of 
1 CONT Edward III, King of England and Philippe de Hainaut.2 He married Lady Eleanor de 
1 CONT Bohun, daughter of Humphrey de Bohun, 7th Earl of Hereford and Joan FitzAlan, 
1 CONT between 1374 and 1376.1 He died on 8 September 1397 at age 42 at Prince's Inn, 
1 CONT Calais, France, murdered, probably on the orders of King Richard II.1 He was 
1 CONT buried at Collegiate Church of the Holy Trinity, Pleshy, Essex, England.1 He was 
1 CONT buried at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, London, England.</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester was created 1st Earl of 
1 CONT Buckingham [England] on 16 July 1377.3 He was invested as a Knight, Order of the 
1 CONT Garter (K.G.) between April 1380 and April 1381.1 As a result of his marriage, 
1 CONT Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester was styled as Earl of Essex 
1 CONT on 22 June 1380.1 He was created 1st Duke of Gloucester on 6 August 1385.1</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Circa 10 September 1397 he was attainted, with all of his honours forfeited.3</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt"><b>Children</b> of Thomas of Woodstock, 1st and last Duke of Gloucester and Lady 
1 CONT Eleanor de Bohun</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160; * Humphrey of Buckingham, Earl of Buckingham b. c Apr 1381, d. 2 Sep 13993</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160; * Anne of Woodstock, Countess of Buckingham+ b. Apr 1383, d. bt 16 Oct 1438 - 
1 CONT 24 Oct 14383</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160; * Joan of Woodstock b. 1384, d. 16 Aug 1400</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160; * Isabella of Woodstock b. 12 Mar 1385/86, d. c Apr 1402</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160;&#160; * Philippa Plantagenet b. c 1389, d. b 3 Oct 13994</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
