1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160; 1. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, 
1 CONT U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 113. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal 
1 CONT Family.</span></div>
