1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Charles V the Wise
1 CONT King of France (more…)
1 CONT Reign 8 April 1364 – 16 September 1380
1 CONT Coronation 19 May 1364, Reims
1 CONT Titles Dauphin of Viennois: As heir (22 August 1350 – 8 April 1364);
1 CONT As King: (8 April 1364 – 7 June 1366);
1 CONT (21 December 1366 – 3 December 1368)
1 CONT Duke of Normandy (1355–64)
1 CONT Born 21 January 1338(1338-01-21)
