1 CONT Died 16 September 1380 (aged 42)
1 CONT Beauté-sur-Marne, France
1 CONT Buried Saint Denis Basilica
1 CONT Predecessor John II
1 CONT Successor Charles VI
1 CONT Consort Joanna of Bourbon (1338–78)
1 CONT Issue Charles VI (1368–1422)
