0 @N6000000005076703916@ NOTE Henri VII de Luxembourg, Holy Roman Emperor was born circa 1274. He was the son of Henri VI, Comte de Luxembourg and Beatrix d'Avesnes.2 He married Marguerite de Brabant, daughter of Jean I de Brabant, Duc de Brabant and Marguerit
1 CONC e de Flandre, on 9 June 1292. He died on 24 August 1313.
1 CONT      Henri VII de Luxembourg, Holy Roman Emperor succeeded to the title of Comte de Luxembourg in 1288.3 He succeeded to the title of King Henrich VII of the Romans in 1308.4 He abdicated as Count of Luxemburg in 1310. He gained t
1 CONC he title of King Heinrich VII of Bohemia in 1310.5 He was crowned Holy Roman Emperor in 1312.4 He succeeded to the title of Emperor Henrich VII of the Holy Roman Empire in 1312.1
